        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "text": "Reading a PDF is not the same as reading its text. The file stores glyphs at absolute positions, and nothing1 in the format says which line follows which or where a paragraph ends. A reader that wants to reflow the text must rebuild that structure from geometry alone, line by line and column by column.",
